---
// Features section
---

<section id="features" class="bg-muted/50 py-20">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
    <h2 class="mb-12 text-center text-4xl font-bold">
      Why Choose Kalaris Labs?
    </h2>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 md:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="bg-card border-border rounded-lg border p-6">
        <div
          class="bg-primary/10 mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg"
        >
          <svg
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            width="24"
            height="24"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            class="text-primary"
          >
            <path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5z"></path>
            <path d="M2 17l10 5 10-5"></path>
            <path d="M2 12l10 5 10-5"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="mb-2 text-xl font-semibold">Cutting-Edge Technology</h3>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground">
          We leverage the latest technologies to build scalable and efficient
          solutions.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-card border-border rounded-lg border p-6">
        <div
          class="bg-primary/10 mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg"
        >
          <svg
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            width="24"
            height="24"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            class="text-primary"
          >
            <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="mb-2 text-xl font-semibold">Security First</h3>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground">
          Security is built into every layer of our applications from the ground
          up.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-card border-border rounded-lg border p-6">
        <div
          class="bg-primary/10 mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg"
        >
          <svg
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            width="24"
            height="24"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            class="text-primary"
          >
            <path d="M13 2L3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="mb-2 text-xl font-semibold">Lightning Fast</h3>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground">
          Optimized performance that delivers exceptional user experiences.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
